== Trivia ==
*'''Scatha''' is a reference to the [https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/Scatha Scatha] from ''The Lord of the Rings''.
*'''Scathas''' and {{MobSprite|Stoneworm}}s are affected by {{NPCSprite|Derpy;Mayor Derpy}}'s {{AN|DOUBLE MOB HP!!!}} perk.
*Players must hit the head of a '''Scatha''' at least once in order to be eligible for loot share. Hitting another part does not count.
*When loot sharing, at most 1 {{Item|Scatha Pet}} used to be able to drop among all loot share contributors. This limit doesn't exist anymore since presumably the October 5th 2026 update, which might be unintended.{{ConfirmationNeeded}}
*[[Huntaxes]] do not work on '''Scathas''', presumably due to them being hit-based instead of using regular Health.

